+ * Upstream Wine's d3d11 implements ID3D11Device & co. on top of wined3d (OpenGL/Vulkan).
+ * The console has neither, but it has D3D11On12.  So D3D11CreateDevice* now:
+ *
+ *   1. asks the host for a native D3D12 device on the Xbox adapter,
